## How to Use This Document

- Lessons are numbered **globally** across all sessions (never reset).
- Each lesson has three required fields: **Context**, **Lesson**, **Prevention**.
- Reference lessons by number elsewhere (e.g. "See Lesson #12" in BACKLOG.md or CLAUDE.md).
- Lessons that become recurring rules should be **promoted** to CLAUDE.md or a constitutional module.

